    "body": "Another option is that the `gzip` binary has somehow gotten clobbered and is no longer a valid executable. It seems that [this kind of error message can arise when a binary is miscompiled or if it's run on the wrong architecture](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/57446579/executable-says-line-1-elf-not-found-when-starts)",
