    "body": "@chipbuster: You are completely right, thanks! I forgot to run `wsl --set-default-version 2` before installing Ubuntu. I have been thinking all the time that it should be based on WSL 2, but I was proven wrong when I have listed all the distros with `wsl -l -v`.\r\n\r\nNow, `gzip` works together with `starship` on [Ubuntu 22.04 LTS](https://www.microsoft.com/store/productId/9PN20MSR04DW); therefore, we can close this issue.",
